WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:17.317
Izzie could not believe her eyes.

2
00:00:18.377 --> 00:00:20.499
On the floor of the gym were hula hoops.

3
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.381
Big hula hoops.

4
00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:24.402
Small hula hoops.

5
00:00:25.263 --> 00:00:26.564
Colorful hula hoops.

6
00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:29.607
"Miss Shelly!

7
00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:30.768
How did you know?"

8
00:00:31.324 --> 00:00:32.264
Izzie burst out.

9
00:00:32.284 --> 00:00:34.025
"Hi, Izzie.

10
00:00:35.205 --> 00:00:36.365
How did I know what?"

11
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:38.106
Miss Shelly looked puzzled.

12
00:00:38.126 --> 00:00:41.007
"I love hula hoops!"

13
00:00:41.527 --> 00:00:42.147
Izzie said.

14
00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.008
"I got one for my birthday last week."

15
00:00:45.648 --> 00:00:48.008
"I didn't know.

16
00:00:48.029 --> 00:00:49.809
That's great.

17
00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:54.310
Today you'll learn some hula hoop games," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.611
"Games?" Izzie frowned.

19
00:00:57.631 --> 00:01:00.892
"I like to just twirl it around my hips."

20
00:01:05.805 --> 00:01:08.826
on your coats and grab a hoop," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:09.826 --> 00:01:12.467
Izzie grabbed a hoop with green and pink stripes.

22
00:01:18.809 --> 00:01:22.290
sky is so gray," Nina said, rubbing her hands.

23
00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.831
"Put down your hoops," Miss Shelly said.

24
00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:28.612
"Join hands and make a circle."

25
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:32.701
Izzie sighed.

26
00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.262
When would they get to hula hoop?

27
00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:40.525
"For the first activity, we have to work as a team," Miss Shelly said.

28
00:01:40.545 --> 00:01:44.007
"Can I join here?"

29
00:01:45.988 --> 00:01:48.890
She stepped into the circle between Izzie and Jason.

30
00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:51.431
She joined hands with Jason.

31
00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:56.374
Before she took Izzie's hand, she put her arm through a hula hoop.

32
00:01:56.394 --> 00:02:00.496
"We're going to pass the hula hoop around the circle.

33
00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.484
But we can't let go of each other's hands," Miss Shelly said.

34
00:02:05.504 --> 00:02:09.627
"What? How will we pass it?"

35
00:02:10.108 --> 00:02:10.808
Izzie asked.

36
00:02:11.949 --> 00:02:13.110
Miss Shelly smiled.

37
00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.412
"You'll figure it out."

38
00:02:17.955 --> 00:02:19.576
Miss Shelly lowered her shoulder.

39
00:02:20.517 --> 00:02:23.019
The hula hoop slipped down to Izzie's left arm.

40
00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.181
Izzie put her head through it.

41
00:02:25.962 --> 00:02:28.064
Then she wriggled the rest of her body through.

42
00:02:28.792 --> 00:02:31.334
She stepped out of it and it was on her right arm!

43
00:02:31.354 --> 00:02:33.835
"I did it!"

44
00:02:34.255 --> 00:02:34.976
she squealed.

45
00:02:34.996 --> 00:02:37.317
"Nina, your turn!"

46
00:02:40.198 --> 00:02:41.579
Nina did what Izzie did.

47
00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.861
Soon the hoop was around Bobby's arm.

48
00:02:46.962 --> 00:02:48.343
Bobby moved it to Ethan.

49
00:02:49.463 --> 00:02:53.005
Ethan moved it to Jason, and Jason moved it to Miss Shelly.

50
00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.327
It made a full circle!

51
00:02:56.567 --> 00:02:57.288
"We did it!"

52
00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.781
Jason cried.

53
00:02:59.681 --> 00:03:00.682
Everyone cheered.

54
00:03:00.702 --> 00:03:04.544
"What did you have to do to stay together?"

55
00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.024
Miss Shelly asked.

56
00:03:07.145 --> 00:03:08.126
Bobby spoke up.

57
00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:11.427
"I had to watch whenever Nina moved.

58
00:03:12.448 --> 00:03:15.389
If she bent down, I had to bend down too."

59
00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:17.651
Izzie nodded.

60
00:03:17.671 --> 00:03:21.453
"The hardest part was not letting go of each other's hands.

61
00:03:22.593 --> 00:03:24.274
Now when do we get to hula hoop?"

62
00:03:24.714 --> 00:03:25.295
she asked.

63
00:03:25.315 --> 00:03:28.672
"Very soon," Miss Shelly said.

64
00:03:28.692 --> 00:03:32.334
"Roll your hula hoop on the blacktop.

65
00:03:33.214 --> 00:03:35.895
Wherever it lands, start hula hooping!"

66
00:03:39.637 --> 00:03:41.618
Izzie took off her jacket and shivered.

67
00:03:42.498 --> 00:03:45.279
She picked up her hoop and rolled it across the blacktop.

68
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.201
Then she ran after it.

69
00:03:49.201 --> 00:03:51.962
When it stopped, she spun it around her waist.

70
00:03:53.963 --> 00:03:56.064
The hula hoop flew around and around.

71
00:03:57.244 --> 00:03:58.505
It was so much fun!

72
00:03:59.565 --> 00:04:01.206
She was in hula hooping heaven!

73
00:04:02.647 --> 00:04:03.688
She looked at Nina.

74
00:04:04.548 --> 00:04:05.909
She was hula hooping too.

75
00:04:06.969 --> 00:04:08.830
The boys kept dropping theirs though.

76
00:04:09.871 --> 00:04:12.032
Izzie felt like she could hula hoop forever.

77
00:04:13.133 --> 00:04:14.473
She looked up at the sky.

78
00:04:15.514 --> 00:04:16.474
It was getting dark.

79
00:04:17.615 --> 00:04:20.596
Suddenly something wet landed on her face.

80
00:04:20.617 --> 00:04:24.639
"Snowflakes!" Nina cried.

81
00:04:25.739 --> 00:04:26.960
It was starting to snow!

82
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.601
"I've never seen real snow!"

83
00:04:30.042 --> 00:04:30.702
Ethan said.

84
00:04:30.722 --> 00:04:34.145
"Hooray!" Izzie cried.

85
00:04:35.065 --> 00:04:37.207
Snow was her favorite thing about winter.

86
00:04:37.227 --> 00:04:39.489
"Hooray for hula hoops!

87
00:04:40.749 --> 00:04:42.911
Hooray for hula hooping in the snow!"
